# Stray image/logo source drops in the repo root. Broadcaster logos are
# processed into deploy/logos/ (operator-local, git-ignored there as well);
# raw downloads shouldn't sit in the project root. Root-anchored so tracked
# images under subdirs (e.g. deploy/logos/_default.svg) are unaffected.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.webp
/*.gif

# Real per-deployment receiver config -- copy deploy/config.yml.example /
# stations.yml.example to start. The operator's real files (this exact
# station list, gain, calibration notes) live in a separate, private
# infra repo, not here.
deploy/config.yml
deploy/stations.yml

# Same story for the real admin-password / secret env files (copy
# deploy/.env.example to start) -- deploy/.env is already covered by the
# generic .env rule above; these are its rx.env/web.env counterparts
# (--env-file deploy/rx.env for compose.rx.yml).
deploy/rx.env
deploy/web.env

# CTest scratch dir (accidentally tracked upstream)
rx/Testing/
